{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":226685,"name":"DOhertyryan","username":"DOhertyryan","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-07-27T21:00:12.832Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHello,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m an individual developer based in the UK, operating as a sole trader — registered with HMRC and holding a UTR (Unique Taxpayer Reference), but I do not have a limited company, a company registration number, or a VAT number. Before investing time building on Forge, I’d like to confirm whether I’m eligible to publish and monetise a paid app on the Atlassian Marketplace.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’m asking because the documentation appears to conflict:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e“Become a partner” (\u003ca href=\"https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/become-a-partner/\"\u003ehttps://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/become-a-partner/\u003c/a\u003e) states that individuals can register “using your name”, which reads as sole-trader-friendly.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e“Partner due diligence” (\u003ca href=\"https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/partner-due-diligence/\"\u003ehttps://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/partner-due-diligence/\u003c/a\u003e) describes a KYC/KYB flow asking for “business name, physical address, registration number and/or tax identification number”. The “and/or” suggests a tax identification number alone may suffice — which as a UK sole trader I do have — but it isn’t explicit, and it’s unclear whether the verification form will actually accept a UTR where a company registration number is expected.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAn existing community topic titled “Does Atlassian no longer support Individual Developers publishing apps?” paraphrases Atlassian support as saying individuals without a business entity “generally cannot publish apps or sell/monetize them” — but that is a user paraphrase rather than an official statement, which is why I’d like this confirmed directly.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCould you please confirm:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCan a UK sole trader (HMRC UTR, no limited company and no company registration number) register as a paid Marketplace vendor and receive payouts? A clear yes or no is what I need most.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIf yes — what should be entered in the partner verification / KYC-KYB flow where a “registration number” is requested? Does a UTR satisfy it?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIf no — is forming a UK limited company the supported route, or is there another path for sole traders?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDoes the answer differ between free and paid apps? I specifically intend to publish paid apps.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’d rather establish this before building than discover an eligibility problem afterwards. Thank you.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-07-27T21:00:12.832Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":13,"reads":39,"readers_count":38,"score":72.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":101919,"topic_slug":"can-a-uk-sole-trader-no-limited-company-register-as-a-paid-marketplace-vendor","display_username":"DOhertyryan","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/become-a-partner/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":1},{"url":"https://developer.atlassian.com/platform/marketplace/partner-due-diligence/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":0},{"url":"https://community.developer.atlassian.com/t/is-canada-a-supported-payout-country-for-marketplace-partners/103113/3","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Is Canada a supported payout country for Marketplace Partners?","clicks":0},{"url":"https://community.developer.atlassian.com/t/partner-verification-for-a-swiss-sole-proprietorship-einzelunternehmen-what-exactly-is-needed/102458/2","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Partner Verification for a Swiss sole proprietorship (Einzelunternehmen) - what exactly is needed?","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":45224,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-a-uk-sole-trader-no-limited-company-register-as-a-paid-marketplace-vendor/101919/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true,"can_vote":false},{"id":226840,"name":"Ian [Atlassian]","username":"ianRagudo","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.developer.atlassian.com/ianragudo/{size}/44527_2.png","created_at":"2026-08-03T05:50:56.297Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/dohertyryan\"\u003e@DOhertyryan\u003c/a\u003e , welcome to the Atlassian Developer Community!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRegarding your questions, I reached out to the team who can help you. I was advised to have you create a request in \u003ca href=\"https://ecosystem.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/34/group/110/create/654\"\u003ethis portal\u003c/a\u003e and continue the conversation there. Once you’ve already created the request, kindly share it with me as a response to this thread or as a direct message so that I can properly endorse it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCheers,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIan\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-08-03T05:50:56.297Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":32,"readers_count":31,"score":11.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":101919,"topic_slug":"can-a-uk-sole-trader-no-limited-company-register-as-a-paid-marketplace-vendor","display_username":"Ian [Atlassian]","primary_group_name":"Atlassian-Staff","flair_name":"Atlassian-Staff","flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":44,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://ecosystem.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/34/group/110/create/654","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Jira Service Management","clicks":2}],"read":true,"user_title":"Expert - Level 5","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":23421,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-a-uk-sole-trader-no-limited-company-register-as-a-paid-marketplace-vendor/101919/3","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":true,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":226851,"name":"DOhertyryan","username":"DOhertyryan","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-08-03T12:40:45.431Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks Ian, much appreciated. I’ve raised it as \u003cstrong\u003eECOHELP-151223\u003c/strong\u003e — \u003ca href=\"https://ecosystem.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/34/ECOHELP-151223\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eJira Service Management\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne thing worth flagging: the portal form requires a numeric Partner/Vendor ID, which a prospective partner asking about eligibility can’t have. I entered 0 as a placeholder and explained it in the first line of the description.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-08-03T12:40:45.431Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":3,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":27,"readers_count":26,"score":10.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":101919,"topic_slug":"can-a-uk-sole-trader-no-limited-company-register-as-a-paid-marketplace-vendor","display_username":"DOhertyryan","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://ecosystem.atlassian.net/servicedesk/customer/portal/34/ECOHELP-151223","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Jira Service Management","clicks":1}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":23421,"username":"ianRagudo","name":"Ian [Atlassian]","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.developer.atlassian.com/ianragudo/{size}/44527_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":45224,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-a-uk-sole-trader-no-limited-company-register-as-a-paid-marketplace-vendor/101919/4","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":226874,"name":"Ian [Atlassian]","username":"ianRagudo","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.developer.atlassian.com/ianragudo/{size}/44527_2.png","created_at":"2026-08-04T01:03:39.564Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/dohertyryan\"\u003e@DOhertyryan\u003c/a\u003e . I relayed the relevant internal conversations and document to the support team that will handle your query; the team will reply within their SLA.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCheers,\u003cbr\u003e\nIan\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":6,"updated_at":"2026-08-04T01:03:39.564Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":4,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":22,"readers_count":21,"score":9.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":101919,"topic_slug":"can-a-uk-sole-trader-no-limited-company-register-as-a-paid-marketplace-vendor","display_username":"Ian [Atlassian]","primary_group_name":"Atlassian-Staff","flair_name":"Atlassian-Staff","flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":44,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Expert - Level 5","title_is_group":false,"reply_to_user":{"id":45224,"username":"DOhertyryan","name":"DOhertyryan","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":23421,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/can-a-uk-sole-trader-no-limited-company-register-as-a-paid-marketplace-vendor/101919/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":true},{"id":226888,"name":"DOhertyryan","username":"DOhertyryan","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/d/97f17d/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-08-04T13:10:47.025Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eMuch appreciated, Ian — thank you for chasing this internally\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1